notes.notes:
Hi, everyone! Changes in new version are mostly about game mode UI, but there are also changes to weapon behaviour and balance: 

Reworked overall UI for Race, Duel and King of the Hill game modes: added UI animations, changed font, replaced old icons;

Reworked leaderboard UI;

Reworked player info UI: nickname, status effect, stamina and etc. display is changed;

Added score display for King of the Hill leaderboard;

Added stopwatch display for Race UI;

Changed timer display format to minutes + seconds;

Changed crosshair to a larger one and more visible;

Weapon shooting mechanic is reworked: LMB and RMB is now separate weapon abilities that have their own cooldowns;

(Black Hole Generator, LMB) Increased push force by 30%;

(BoxGlove, RMB) Increased AoE push force by 23%;

(Harpoon, LMB) Reduced push force of hit players by 8%;

(Harpoon, RMB) Reduced pull force by 25%;

Fixed a bug where sound of booster pick up didn't play;

Added ragdoll stun;

Added new weapon: Harpoon;

Added 5 new tattoos;

Added 3 new coloring variations for BoxGlove;

Added 3 new coloring variations for Mortar;

Added 3 new coloring variations for Harpoon;

Added new player movement animations;

(Rocket Launcher) Increased reload speed by 30%;

(Rocket Launcher \\ Mortar, RMB) Increased AoE force after rocket jump by 20%;

(Rocket Launcher \\ Mortar, RMB) Reduced hit player's air launch height after a rocket jump by 26%;

(Black Hole Generator, LMB) Increased black hole activation distance to 8 meters;

(Box Glove) Reduced dash speed by 5%;

(Booster "Acceleration") Increased acceleration speed by 25%;

(Booster "Acceleration") Reduced acceleration duration to 4 seconds;

Increased round duration on some maps;

Fixed a bug where run VFX can be appear in the air;

Fixed a bug where player could move by inertia after respawning;



